setup_notes.content:
Add this to your `mycroft.conf`:

{
  "stt": {
    "module": "ovos-stt-plugin-rover",
    "ovos-stt-plugin-rover": {
        "timeout": 12,
        "workers": 4,
        "backends": [
          {
            "module": "ovos-stt-plugin-whisper",
            "config": {
              "model": "small.en"
            }
          },
          {
            "module": "ovos-stt-plugin-vosk",
            "config": {
              "model": "vosk-model-en-us"
            }
          },
          {
            "module": "ovos-stt-plugin-xxx",
            "config": {
              "model": "..."
            }
          }
        ]
    }
  }
}

### Fields

| Key        | Meaning                                        |
| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| `timeout`  | Tota…
